        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 75.32,
          "end": 78.82,
          "en": "So I will destructure a props object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.82,
          "end": 81.34,
          "en": "expecting a onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.34,
          "end": 84.44,
          "en": "a icon prop and a children prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 84.44,
          "end": 86.92,
          "en": "Children will be the text that should displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 86.92,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "on this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.82,
          "en": "So it will be passed between the opening and closing text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 90.82,
          "end": 92.563,
          "en": "of our Custom Component later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 93.65,
          "end": 96.32,
          "en": "The name of the Ionicons icon here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 96.32,
          "end": 98.273,
          "en": "will be the icon we receive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.25,
          "end": 102.17,
          "en": "and the Pressable Component will receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 102.17,
          "end": 103.65,
          "en": "the onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 103.65,
          "end": 108.14,
          "en": "which points at the onPress prop value we get from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.14,
          "end": 110.35,
          "en": "Now we will also need some styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.35,
          "end": 113.3,
          "en": "with that Styles object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.3,
          "end": 114.57,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 117.86,
          "en": "And I also want to make sure that on this icon here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 117.86,
          "end": 120.15,
          "en": "we set a size of 18,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 121.83,
          "en": "and add the color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 121.83,
          "end": 124.67,
          "en": "And the color here is Colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 124.67,
          "end": 126.47,
          "en": "using my colors constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 126.47,
          "end": 128.14,
          "en": "which is imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 128.14,
          "end": 130.993,
          "en": "dot primary500.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 132.45,
          "end": 135.18,
          "en": "And then here in this StyleSheet object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 135.18,
          "end": 137.21,
          "en": "we can add a general button style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 137.21,
          "end": 140.47,
          "en": "which will be added to the Pressable Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 140.47,
          "end": 141.99,
          "en": "then a pressed style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 141.99,
          "end": 145.4,
          "en": "which should become active when it is being pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 145.4,
          "end": 147.59,
          "en": "Then a style for the icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 147.59,
          "end": 150.343,
          "en": "and a style for the text in the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 152.8,
          "en": "Now for the button itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 152.8,
          "end": 154.99,
          "en": "I want to have some padding horizontal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 154.99,
          "end": 155.93,
          "en": "so left to the right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 155.93,
          "end": 156.763,
          "en": "of 12,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 156.763,
          "end": 159.923,
          "en": "and a padding vertical of six,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 161.34,
          "end": 163.17000000000002,
          "en": "and some spacing around the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 163.17000000000002,
          "end": 164.72,
          "en": "for which we can add margin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 164.72,
          "end": 166.363,
          "en": "for example, to four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 169.15,
          "end": 172.16,
          "en": "We can then also add JustifyContent, center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 172.16,
          "end": 174.07,
          "en": "and alignItems, center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 174.07,
          "end": 175.68,
          "en": "to make sure that all the content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 175.68,
          "end": 176.78,
          "en": "so the icon ends,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 176.78,
          "end": 178.24,
          "en": "the text is centered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 178.24,
          "end": 181.21,
          "en": "and that they are aligned on the same line,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 181.21,
          "end": 182.943,
          "en": "horizontally and vertically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 184.67,
          "end": 187.98,
          "en": "Then we can add a border with a width of one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 187.98,
          "end": 189.83,
          "en": "and a border color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 189.83,
          "end": 193.04,
          "en": "which can be Colors.primary500.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 193.04,
          "end": 196.54,
          "en": "So the same color as I chose for the icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 196.54,
          "end": 199.4,
          "en": "and I'll set flexDirection here to row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 199.4,
          "end": 202.62,
          "en": "so that the icon and the text sit next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 202.62,
          "end": 205.79,
          "en": "And I will actually add this above my justifyContent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 205.79,
          "end": 207.74,
          "en": "and alignItems settings,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 207.74,
          "end": 212.04,
          "en": "so that I have all the flex box settings grouped together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 212.04,
          "end": 214.17000000000002,
          "en": "This is not required technically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 214.17000000000002,
          "end": 217.053,
          "en": "but can help with reading and understanding this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 221.5,
          "en": "Now for the pressed style, as of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 221.5,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "I want to change the opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 225.34,
          "en": "to make it slightly transparent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 225.34,
          "end": 228.68,
          "en": "and then for the style that will be applied to the icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 228.68,
          "end": 231.02,
          "en": "I just want to make sure that there is some spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 231.02,
          "end": 232.75,
          "en": "between the icon and the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 232.75,
          "end": 235.76,
          "en": "So here I will add marginRight of six,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 235.76,
          "end": 238.91,
          "en": "because the icon will be on the left side of the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 238.91,
          "end": 240.35,
          "en": "So by adding marginRight,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 243.52,
          "en": "there be some space between the icon and the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 243.52,
          "end": 247.08,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could have added marginLeft to the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 247.08,
          "end": 248.15,
          "en": "But here on the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 248.15,
          "end": 250.1,
          "en": "I'll now just set a color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 250.1,
          "end": 253.02,
          "en": "and set this to primary500 as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 253.02,
          "end": 255.62,
          "en": "so that icon text and border of the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 255.62,
          "end": 257.153,
          "en": "all have the same color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 258.15,
          "end": 261.43,
          "en": "With that, all these style objects are defined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 261.43,
          "end": 263.39,
          "en": "and they can now be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 263.39,
          "end": 265.16,
          "en": "Here on Pressable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 265.16,
          "end": 268.19,
          "en": "it's the button style that's added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 268.19,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "on the icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 271.363,
          "en": "it's the icon style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 272.36,
          "end": 273.78,
          "en": "and on the text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 273.78,
          "end": 275.963,
          "en": "it's of course, the text style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 277.13,
          "end": 279.96,
          "en": "Now back here to the Pressable style though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 279.96,
          "end": 283.1,
          "en": "there, I actually want to use a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 283.1,
          "end": 286.2,
          "en": "and pass an array of styles then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 286.2,
          "end": 287.57,
          "en": "and this function, as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 287.57,
          "end": 289.77,
          "en": "gets an object with a press prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 289.77,
          "end": 293.85,
          "en": "which allows us to conditionally add the pressed style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 293.85,
          "end": 294.733,
          "en": "to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 296.63,
          "end": 297.87,
          "en": "But with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 297.87,
          "end": 299.59000000000003,
          "en": "the OutlinedButton is finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 299.59000000000003,
          "end": 302.95,
          "en": "and I now want to use that here in my image picker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 302.95,
          "end": 305.65,
          "en": "There, instead of using this built-in button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 305.65,
          "end": 307.05,
          "en": "I'll use the OutlinedButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 308.494,
          "end": 309.59,
          "en": "And for this, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 309.59,
          "end": 312.487,
          "en": "we should import the OutlinedButton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 312.487,
          "end": 315.423,
          "en": "and we can get rid of the import of the built-in button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 316.42,
          "end": 321.27,
          "en": "And then here we don't set a title prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 321.27,
          "end": 324.6,
          "en": "instead, we use opening and closing tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 324.6,
          "end": 326.46,
          "en": "and pass our title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 326.46,
          "end": 330.03,
          "en": "our button caption between the opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 330.03,
          "end": 332.17,
          "en": "And then we need to set the icon here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 332.17,
          "end": 334,
          "en": "and here I'll set the icon to camera,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 334,
          "end": 337.293,
          "en": "which is one of the supported icon names by Ionicons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 338.31,
          "end": 339.74,
          "en": "And if we save all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 339.74,
          "end": 342.5,
          "en": "we got this nice looking button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 342.5,
          "end": 345.33,
          "en": "which I prefer over the button we had before,",
          "zh": ""
